title: Should an atom have only one author?
pid: 0083ca9e-aa6b-460e-9003-a8644c91a9bc
body: |2-
  Some atoms could be written by committee.
  I suspect that is usually unworth the effort.
  Skg sidesteps the question of
  how to agree on what an atom (think "document") says.
  Each person decides, relying as much or as little
  on any number of previous authors' shared decisions as they choose.c
